      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"quantum resonance\"... that sounds heavy. so how would that actually work in a practical sense? like, how does a market data flow actually interact with my autonomic nervous system on a quantum level? i'm trying to wrap my head around the actual mechanism of it.",
